/**
 * @defgroup lib_core Core Helpers
 * @brief Pure maths, clock, text, and unit helpers that need no watch SDK.
 *
 * Needing no SDK is what lets them be tested off the watch. Think .beats time, moon phase, weekday
 * names, number formatting, and unit conversions.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup lib_io Data In and Out
 * @brief The AppMessage pipeline to the phone and the byte readers behind it.
 *
 * The stores use the byte readers to unpack the packed strips the phone sends.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup lib_stores Stores
 * @brief Weather, health, calendar, stocks, and the other readings a face shows.
 *
 * Each store keeps its reading fresh and nudges the screen when it changes.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup lib_settings Settings
 * @brief Loads, saves, and syncs a face's settings from its field table.
 *
 * A face hands it a field table, and it handles persist and the phone sync without naming any
 * single setting itself.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup lib_system System Bits
 * @brief Bluetooth buzzing and the watch's own unit settings.
 *
 * The odds and ends that belong to the watch itself rather than to any one face.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup lib_ui UI
 * @brief The slot engine, zones, fonts, icon cache, and weather icons and labels.
 *
 * Everything that puts pixels on the screen, shared by every face's layout.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup lib_dev Dev Harness
 * @brief Fixed fixtures and a theme walk for repeatable screenshots.
 *
 * The frame faces share it. It seeds every store with a fixed fixture and steps through the themes
 * on a tap, so a face's screenshots come out the same every time.
 */
